 New Salem, Grindstone, Clarksville and Centerville.","instruction":"Seek shelter inside a well-built structure and stay away from\nwindows. This storm is capable of producing damaging winds.\n\nContinuous cloud to ground lightning is occurring with this storm.\nLightning is one of nature's leading killers. Remember, if you can\nhear thunder, you are close enough to be struck by lightning.","response":"Shelter","note":null,"parameters":{"AWIPSidentifier":["SVSPBZ"],"WMOidentifier":["WWUS51 KPBZ 090501"],"NWSheadline":["SEVERE THUNDERSTORM WARNING REMAINS IN EFFECT UNTIL 130 AM EDT FOR NORTHWESTERN FAYETTE, NORTHEASTERN GREENE AND SOUTHEASTERN WASHINGTON COUNTIES"],"eventMotionDescription":["2026-08-09T04:51:00-00:00...storm...271DEG...21KT...39.98,-80.12"],"windThreat":["RADAR INDICATED"],"maxWindGust":["60 MPH"],"hailThreat":["RADAR INDICATED"],"BLOCKCHANNEL":["EAS","NWEM","CMAS"],"EAS-ORG":["WXR"],"VTEC":["/O.CON.KPBZ.SV.W.0257.000000T0000Z-260809T0530Z/"],"eventEndingTime":["2026-08-09T01:30:00-04:00"]},"scope":"Public","code":"IPAWSv1.0","language":"en-US","web":"http://www.weather.gov","eventCode":{"SAME":["SVS"],"NationalWeatherService":["SVW"]}}},{"id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.d938d7ceaf5d52d88783b57b3166ec2724515f72.001.1","type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-111.81,34.41],[-111.84,34.41],[-111.88,34.42],[-111.93,34.44],[-111.91,34.46],[-111.81,34.48],[-111.79,34.47],[-111.77,34.45],[-111.81,34.41]]]},"properties":{"@id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.d938d7ceaf5d52d88783b57b3166ec2724515f72.001.1","@type":"wx:Alert","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.d938d7ceaf5d52d88783b57b3166ec2724515f72.001.1","areaDesc":"Yavapai, AZ","geocode":{"SAME":["004025"],"UGC":["AZC025"]},"affectedZones":["https://api.weather.gov/zones/county/AZC025"],"references":[{"@id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.6fdcce3779f61e1220044b842f7413fe097a0a7b.001.1","identifier":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.